   "versionNonce": 924075516,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1  resolve agent from token \u2192 permissions, context, query\n2  scope check  (r / rw / none)   out of scope \u2192 403 + log\n3  build state = request + agent + verified initiator + policy\n4  ask the judge  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25b6\n5  risk score  \u2192  allow | confirm | block\n6  write one audit row",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 16,
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1  resolve agent from token \u2192 permissions, context, query\n2  scope check  (r / rw / none)   out of scope \u2192 403 + log\n3  build state = request + agent + verified initiator + policy\n4  ask the judge  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25b6\n5  risk score  \u2192  allow | confirm | block\n6  write one audit row",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
